{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04912","headline":"陪幸韦嗣立山庄应制 · 李乂","name":"陪幸韦嗣立山庄应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"枢掖调梅暇，林园种槿初。\n入朝荣劒履，退食偶琴书。\n地隐东岩室，天回北斗车。\n旌门临䆗窱，辇道属扶疎。\n云罕明丹谷，霜笳彻紫虚。\n水疑投石处，谿似钓璜余。\n帝泽颁巵酒，人欢颂里闾。\n一承黄竹咏，长奉白茆居。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李乂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04912.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04912","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}